    # factory block) — so the restore condition is met. LEGION_HAS_FEDERATED_KG
    # stays UNDEFINED in this embedded build (the guarded federated-kg surface
    # is build-excluded by design; see AURELIAN-CONFORMANT-FEDERATION-DESIGN.md
